Author:     Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
AuthorDate: Wed Oct 14 13:17:44 2026 +0200
Commit:     Jakub Skokan <jakub.skokan@havefun.cz>
CommitDate: Wed Oct 14 13:42:13 2026 +0200

    coordination: prepare complete hook environments before merging
    
    Enter the declared repository shell so shell initialization installs and
    exports its hook dependencies before admission. Check Overcommit loading
    and SSH transport during preparation, and retain the runtime transport
    path when applying the hook environment. Use the prepared environment for
    target checkout hooks as well as merge and push hooks.
    
    Keep dependency installation outside Git claims and preserve the existing
    artifact and worker formats for interrupted-operation recovery.

